 "title": "Prosecuting Attorney",
 "text": "Prosecuting Attorney\nWelcome to Maries County, Missouri\nHome\nCircuit Clerk\nLicense Fee\nTreasurer\nAssessor\nCollector\nCounty Clerk\nProsecuting Attorney\nCommission\nLocation\nOffice Hours\nM-F, 8-noon & 1-4\nFollow us on Facebook\nThe Gasconade River\nMaries County Court House, Vienna MO\nThe Maries River\nLinks:\nTraffic Citations\nBad Checks\nChild Support\nVictims of Crime\nMore Links\nLaw Enforcement\nFelonies and Misdemeanors\n|\nWelcome to the website for the Maries County Prosecuting Attorney’s Office. The Maries County Prosecuting Attorney is responsible for the enforcement of state criminal law in Maries County, Missouri. The office staff consists of the Prosecuting Attorney, Tony Skouby, and two legal secretaries, Denise Davis and Kristine Click.\nMaries County Courthouse\n4th and Coffey Streets\nP.O. Box 212\nVienna, MO 65582\nTel: 573-422-3396\nFax: 573-422-3829\n|\nHome | Circuit Clerk | License Fee | Treasurer | Assessor | Collector | County Clerk | Prosecuting Attorney | Commission | Location\n|",
